      "description": {
        "en": "The GV18 is a 400W brushless cordless stick vacuum delivering 30kPa of suction in a lightweight body, with a removable 2200mAh battery that runs 20–65 minutes per charge. It handles wet and dry pick-up with a 1.2L dust cup and HEPA filtration, runs at ≤65dB, and features a smart touch LED display. Available as OEM/ODM with custom colour and plug type for your market. Certification documents are on file and available on request.",
        "zh": "GV18 是一款 400W 无刷电机无线立式吸尘器，机身轻巧、吸力达 30kPa，配可拆卸 2200mAh 电池，单次充电续航 20–65 分钟。干湿两用，1.2L 尘杯配 HEPA 滤网，运行噪音 ≤65dB，带智能触控 LED 显示屏。支持 OEM/ODM 定制颜色与插头规格，认证资料已备案、可按需提供。"
      },
